WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:03.881
TREVOR, SHH, GO!
YOU SHOULDN'T BE HERE.

00:00:03.924 --> 00:00:05.796
[CROAKING]

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:06.927
NEITHER SHOULD YOU.

00:00:08.755 --> 00:00:10.888
YOU'RE SNEAKING OUT
AGAIN, AREN'T YOU?

00:00:10.931 --> 00:00:13.107
NOW, NEVILLE, LISTEN.
WE WERE--

00:00:13.151 --> 00:00:15.240
NO! I WON'T LET YOU.

00:00:15.284 --> 00:00:17.547
YOU'LL GET GRYFFINDOR
INTO TROUBLE AGAIN.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.636
I-I'LL FIGHT YOU.

00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:20.811
NEVILLE,

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.116
I'M REALLY, REALLY
SORRY ABOUT THIS.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.510
PETRIFUCUS TOTALUS.

00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:34.825
YOU'RE A LITTLE SCARY
SOMETIMES,

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.174
YOU KNOW THAT?

00:00:36.218 --> 00:00:40.091
BRILLIANT BUT SCARY.

00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:41.658
LET'S GO.

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.312
Harry: SORRY.

00:00:43.355 --> 00:00:44.530
Hermione: SORRY.

00:00:44.574 --> 00:00:46.924
Ron: IT'S FOR
YOUR OWN GOOD, YOU KNOW.

00:00:51.929 --> 00:00:54.497
OW! YOU STOOD ON MY FOOT!

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.238
SORRY.

00:01:00.329 --> 00:01:02.244
Hermione: ALOHOMORA.

00:01:05.116 --> 00:01:07.249
[HARP PLAYING]

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:10.252
[SNORING]

00:01:13.777 --> 00:01:17.911
WAIT A MINUTE, HE'S...

00:01:17.955 --> 00:01:19.522
SNORING.

00:01:19.565 --> 00:01:22.481
[HARP PLAYING]

00:01:22.525 --> 00:01:25.745
Harry: SNAPE'S
ALREADY BEEN HERE.

00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:28.705
HE'S PUT A SPELL
ON THE HARP.

00:01:28.748 --> 00:01:32.230
UHH! IT'S GOT
HORRIBLE BREATH.

00:01:35.146 --> 00:01:37.104
Harry: WE HAVE
TO MOVE ITS PAW.

00:01:37.148 --> 00:01:39.193
WHAT?
COME ON!

00:01:43.415 --> 00:01:45.765
OK, PUSH.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.077
[SNORTS]

00:02:08.092 --> 00:02:09.920
I'LL GO FIRST.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.443
DON'T FOLLOW UNTIL
I GIVE YOU A SIGN.

00:02:11.487 --> 00:02:14.141
IF SOMETHING
BAD HAPPENS,

00:02:14.185 --> 00:02:16.666
GET YOURSELVES OUT.

00:02:18.581 --> 00:02:21.888
DOES IT SEEM
A BIT QUIET TO YOU?

00:02:21.932 --> 00:02:24.935
THE HARP.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.284
IT STOPPED PLAYING.

00:02:29.069 --> 00:02:32.246
UGH! YUCK!

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.683
UGH.

00:02:37.687 --> 00:02:39.123
Harry: JUMP!

00:02:40.211 --> 00:02:42.344
GO!

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.348
AAH!

00:02:46.391 --> 00:02:49.046
AAH!

00:02:49.089 --> 00:02:51.178
[GASPS]

00:02:51.222 --> 00:02:52.484
WHOA.

00:02:52.528 --> 00:02:55.835
LUCKY THIS PLANT-THING
IS HERE, REALLY.

00:02:55.879 --> 00:02:57.707
WHOA!

00:03:02.538 --> 00:03:03.887
OH! AAH!

00:03:11.242 --> 00:03:13.113
Hermione: STOP MOVING,
BOTH OF YOU.

00:03:13.157 --> 00:03:14.463
THIS IS DEVIL'S SNARE.

00:03:14.506 --> 00:03:15.855
YOU HAVE TO RELAX.

00:03:15.899 --> 00:03:18.554
IF YOU DON'T,
IT'LL ONLY KILL YOU FASTER.

00:03:18.597 --> 00:03:20.382
KILL US FASTER?

00:03:20.425 --> 00:03:21.905
OH, NOW I CAN RELAX!

00:03:25.517 --> 00:03:27.040
HERMIONE!
HERMIONE!

00:03:27.084 --> 00:03:29.173
NOW WHAT ARE
WE GONNA DO?!

00:03:29.216 --> 00:03:31.480
Hermione:
JUST RELAX!

00:03:31.523 --> 00:03:33.003
HERMIONE, WHERE ARE YOU?

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:36.136
DO WHAT I SAY!
TRUST ME.

00:03:38.225 --> 00:03:40.663
AAH! HARRY!

00:03:40.706 --> 00:03:42.795
Ron: HARRY!
OOF!

00:03:42.839 --> 00:03:44.014
ARE YOU OK?

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.537
YEAH. YEAH, I'M FINE.

00:03:45.581 --> 00:03:46.669
Ron: HELP!

00:03:46.712 --> 00:03:48.453
HE'S NOT RELAXING,
IS HE?

00:03:48.497 --> 00:03:50.063
APPARENTLY NOT.

00:03:50.107 --> 00:03:51.064
WE'VE GOT TO DO
SOMETHING.

00:03:51.108 --> 00:03:52.631
WHAT?

00:03:52.675 --> 00:03:54.764
I REMEMBER READING
SOMETHING IN HERBOLOGY.

00:03:54.807 --> 00:03:55.765
UM--

00:03:55.808 --> 00:03:57.027
HELP!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.202
Hermione: DEVIL'S SNARE,
DEVIL'S SNARE,

00:03:58.245 --> 00:04:00.465
IT'S DEADLY FUN,

00:04:00.509 --> 00:04:02.598
BUT WILL SULK IN THE SUN.
THAT'S IT!

00:04:02.641 --> 00:04:05.078
DEVIL'S SNARE
HATES SUNLIGHT.

00:04:05.122 --> 00:04:07.820
LUMUS SOLEM.

00:04:07.864 --> 00:04:10.997
[SHRIEKING]

00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:13.478
AAH!

00:04:14.827 --> 00:04:16.481
RON, YOU OK?

00:04:16.525 --> 00:04:18.831
YEAH.
OK.

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:19.832
WHEW!

00:04:19.876 --> 00:04:23.706
LUCKY WE DIDN'T PANIC.

00:04:23.749 --> 00:04:24.821
LUCKY HERMIONE PAYS
ATTENTION IN HERBOLOGY.

